+### How `fund-usdc` works
 
+`packages/foundry/scripts-js/fundUsdc.js` impersonates USDC's real `masterMinter` on the fork (`anvil_impersonateAccount`). It makes that account a minter and calls `mint`. Balances therefore go through the real FiatToken code (total supply, `Transfer` events, blacklist checks), not a raw storage edit. `RPC_URL` overrides the default `http://127.0.0.1:8545`.
 
